  <BetterInspectPane.PawnSkillPassionStyle>技能激情显示</BetterInspectPane.PawnSkillPassionStyle>

  <BetterInspectPane.PawnSkillPassionStyle_Text>文本（+ / ++）</BetterInspectPane.PawnSkillPassionStyle_Text>

  <BetterInspectPane.PawnSkillPassionStyle_Icon>图标</BetterInspectPane.PawnSkillPassionStyle_Icon>

  <BetterInspectPane.PawnSkillPassionStyle_Tip>技能激情的表示方式：文本 = 在技能名后附加 +（轻微）/ ++（重度）；图标 = 绘制原版激情图标。安装 Vanilla Skills Expanded 后，两种方式均自动改用其激情定义，支持冷漠 / 天赋 / 狂热等额外激情种类。</BetterInspectPane.PawnSkillPassionStyle_Tip>

  <BetterInspectPane.PawnSkillPassionIconAfterName>激情图标置于技能名称后</BetterInspectPane.PawnSkillPassionIconAfterName>

  <BetterInspectPane.PawnSkillPassionIconAfterNameTip>仅图标样式生效：开启后激情图标绘制在技能名称右侧（默认绘制在技能名左侧）；技能条剩余宽度放不下图标时不绘制。</BetterInspectPane.PawnSkillPassionIconAfterNameTip>

